# Diamond/Pearl, the Underground trap menu from dp/recipes/underground.recipe
# (recorded from the e2e bots at real text speed): CONTINUE in the
# Underground Man's house, talk to him (three Traps: Move, Bubble, Leaf),
# out to Eterna, Y (the registered Explorer Kit), YES comms / YES save / YES
# overwrite, down into the Underground (map 2), Roark's first-visit talk (A
# every 30 frames), X, TRAPS, the Move Trap: its BURY/TRASH/CANCEL menu
# (~frame 8904). Before armrec kept the Thumb bit on literal-pool function
# words, choosing any trap or sphere here was GF_AssertFail -> comm error ->
# reset (ov18_02249684 never matched its list entry). Then B x3, GO UP, YES:
# back in Eterna (map 65).
